menu "Acuratex firmware options"

    config ACURATEX_USB_DEBUG_JTAG
        bool "Use integrated USB Serial/JTAG instead of Acuratex TinyUSB"
        default n
        help
            Leave GPIO19/GPIO20 available to the ESP32-S3 integrated USB
            Serial/JTAG controller. The Acuratex TinyUSB driver is not
            initialized, while WiFi/TCP, CAN/TWAI and command processing keep
            their normal startup path.

endmenu
